" _____\n|  ___ \\\n| |   \\ \\\n| |   | |   _  _     _____    _____     _____      __  ___\n| |   | |  | |/ \\   / /|  |  / / | |   /     \\    |  \\/   \\\n| |   | |  |  __|  / | |  |  | \\_| |  / _/\\_  \\   |   _   |\n| |__/ /   |  |    \\  \\|  |  \\__   | |  \\  /  |   |  | |  |\n|_____/    |__|     \\__|\\_|     |  |  \\ //\\\\ /    |  | |  |\n                                |  |   \\____/     |__| |__|\n                            __  |  |\n                            \\ \\_/  |\n                             \\____/\n                                        _____              /\\     /\\\n                                       | __  \\            /  \\   /  \\\n                                       ||  |  \\           |  |   |  |\n                                       ||__|  |           |  |   |  |\n                                       |     /     ____   |  |   |  |\n                                       | __  \\    / /| |  |  |   |  |\n                                       ||   | \\  / | | |  |  |   |  |\n                                       ||___| |  \\  \\| |  \\  /   \\  /\n                                       |_____/    \\__|\\|   \\/     \\/\n\n\n                                    ________________\n                                   /                 /\n                                  /                 /\n                                 /     _______     /\n                                /    /        /   /\n                               /   /         /   /\n                               \\ /      ____/   /\n                                      \\          \\\n                                       \\     _____\\\n                                       /    /\n                                      /    /       /\\\n                                     /    /_______/  \\\n                                    /                 \\\n                                   /__________________/\n\n\nTHE LEGACY OF GOKU II\nSCOUTER INFORMATION\nCopyright 2004\n\n\nVERSION HISTORY\n\nVersion .25: 5/15/04\nBirth of this guide, data on alligator through Cooler\nVersion .5: 5/29/04\nAdded to Cell, continued from Cooler to Dog\nVersion .65: 6/10/04\nContinued from Dog to Kami\nVersion 1.0: 6/15/04\nAdded to Eggbot, completed from King Cold to end. Finally!!\nVersion 1.2: 6/18/04\nDid LOTS of corrections that worked their way in by my \ncareless pasting.  Sorry everyone!!!\nVersion 2.0 5/3/05\nAlmost a year later, I changed something so small you won't even be able to \nnotice ;)\n\nOnly www.gamefaqs.com is allowed permission to use this walkthrough.  No other\nsites can or will have permission for the foreseeable future.\n\n\n\nTable of Contents:\n\n1) Title, version history and permission info\n\n2) Table of contents\n\n3) Intro\n\n4) The Scouter and its Functions/How this Guide Works\n\n5) Scouter Data\n\n6) Outro\n\n7) Special Thanks\n\n\n8) Legal Info\n\n\nIntro\n\n\n\nHello and welcome to you, the reader of this guide!  I am eternally\ngrateful (well, not really) to you for coming here. This is the Pokedex of\nDragon Ball Z. The fact that you are reading this means one of several things.\nEither you want to learn more about the Dragon Ball Z characters, you, like me,\nhave no life, or you need help with this totally optional side quest.  Filling\nthe Capsule Corporation’s computer database has no reward other than a\npermanent supply of DBZ info.  So read on, as I unveil The Legacy of Goku’s\ndata spectacular!!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe Scouter and its Functions/How this Guide Works\n\nThe scouter is obtained from Bulma at Capsule Corp. early on in the game.\nIt functions as a map and as an information gathering machine.  The information\nis instantly sent back to the main computer at Capsule Corp. for future\nreference.  Along with information about the character, it also provides stats\nand a head shot. This guide will cover all the info you can gather so if you\nmissed one it doesn’t matter.  The info is listed as such:\n\n     NAME\n     HEALTH\n     STRENGTH\n     POWER\n     ENDURANCE\n     INFO\nSome enemies such as snakes have multiple strengths, so they will have multiple\nnumbers in each category.  Info is listed in alphabetical order\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nScouter Data\n\n\nAlligator\nHP: 600\nSTR: 29\nPOW: 1\nEND: 20\nThese fearsome reptiles live near water in the tropics and will fiercely\nprotect their territory.  Strong jaws and sharp teethe make alligators a\nformidable foe.\n\n\n\nAndroid 16\nHP: 4480\nSTR: 42\nPOW: 50\nEND: 39\n\nAlthough this being appears to be a human, it is actually an Android.  Scanning\nof this Android reveals components created by Dr. Gero.  Sensors are unable to\nanalyze the complex neural position matrix in this being’s electronic brain.\nHowever, files contained in the holographic stem memory reveal that the primary\nmission of this Android is to destroy Goku.  The extent of this Android’s power\nis unknown.\n\n\n\nAndroid 17\nHP: 3550\nSTR: 32\nPOW: 39\nEND: 34\nAlthough this being appears to be a teenage boy, it is actually an Android.\nScanning of this Android reveals components created by Dr. Gero.  Scanning of\nthe holographic memory reveals that the primary mission of this android is to\ndestroy Goku and the secondary mission of causing pain and suffering.  The\nneural net structure of this being shows a high capacity for independent\nthought, making him highly unpredictable.  This Android is extremely powerful\nand highly dangerous.\n\n\n\n\nAndroid 18\nHP: 2910\nSTR: 29\nPOW: 34\nEND: 27\nAlthough this being appears to be a teenage girl, it is actually an Android.\nScanning of this Android reveals components created by Dr. Gero.  Scanning of\nthe holographic memory reveals that the primary mission of this android is to\ndestroy Goku and the secondary mission of causing pain and suffering.  The\nneural net structure of this being shows a high capacity for independent\nthought, making her highly unpredictable.  This Android is extremely powerful\nand highly dangerous.\n\n\n\nAndroid 19\nHP: 2970\nSTR: 21\nPOW: 14\nEND: 11\nAlthough this being appears to be a portly clown, it is actually an Android.\nScanning of this Android reveals components created by Dr. Gero.  Scanning of\nthe holographic memory reveals that the primary mission of this android is to\ndestroy Goku and the secondary mission of causing pain and suffering.  This\nAndroid is equipped with and energy absorbing device capable of extracting\nenergy from organic beings. This Android is extremely powerful and highly\ndangerous.\n\n\n\nAndroid 20\nHP: 2810, 1900\n\nSTR: 24, 25\nPOW: 19, 21\nEND: 14, 17\nThis being is an exact visual match of the notorious scientist Dr. Gero,\nhowever further analysis of this being reveal that it is an advanced cybernetic\norganism.  The Android’s body is purely mechanical; however the being’s brain\nis organic.  This Android is equipped with an energy absorbing device capable\nof extracting energy from organic beings.  Dr. Gero is a fugitive from the law,\nand is extremely dangerous.  Once the chief scientist of the Red Ribbon Army,\nhe is wanted on charges of conspiracy to commit treason and murder, and\nunlawful experimentation on human subjects.\n\n\n\nBulma\nHP: 22\nSTR: 2\nPOW: 1\nEND: 2\nBulma Briefs is the daughter of the founder and president of the Capsule\nCorporation, Dr. Briefs.  Bulma has many invention patents in her name, most\nnotably the Dragon Radar, a device designed to detect the unique energy\nsignature associated with the ancient artifacts known as the Dragon Balls\n\n\n\nButterfly\nHP: 1\nSTR: 1\nPOW: 1\nEND: 1\nThe butterfly is a harmless insect characterized by its colorful wings and thin\nbody.\n\n\n\nCat\nHP: 6\nSTR: 1\nPOW: 1\nEND: 1\nCommon domesticated animal often kept as pets.\n\n\n\nCell\nHP: 5210\nSTR: 32\nPOW: 32\nEND: 37\nThis being resembles no known species of animal or any known type of\ntechnology.  Analysis of the cellular structure of this being reveals evidence\nof artificial genetic engineering.  Extraterrestrial origin may be possible.\nThe body of this creature is covered in a thick carapace.  The calcareous\nexoskeleton of this being is unusually hardy, and is possibly resistant to most\nforms of attack, including gunfire and explosives.  The scorpion-like tail of\nthis creature absorbs life energy.  Approach with extreme caution.\n\n\n\n\nCell, Nonperfect\nHP: 4850\nSTR: 39\nPOW: 41\nEND: 26\nAfter absorbing Android 17 the creature know as Cell transformed.  Structural\nanalysis reveals increased muscle mass and increased thickness in exoskeleton.\nDeeper analysis reveals mechanical and organic fusion that is not yet\nunderstood.  Despite data analysis, this being is still not understood.  Due to\nthe sheer complexity of this creature, understanding may be impossible.\nAnalysis of this creature’s energy patterns reveal wave structures that\nindicate a high power level.\n\n\n\nCell, Perfect\nHP: 5160, 5500, 6500, 8230\nSTR: 44, 50, 60\nPOW: 46, 55, 59\nEND: 50, 60, 65\nAfter absorbing Android 18 Cell has reached what he calls his Perfect form.\nMassive biomechanical changes have occurred on all levels of Cell’s structure.\nCell’s facial structure has become more humanoid and his tall atrophied\n(perhaps it is now vestigial??)  His coloration has also changed due to an\nalteration of his chemical make up.  The effect on his power level is so\ndrastic that it cannot be calculated.\n\n\n\nCell Junior\nHP: 4990\nSTR: 46\nPOW: 50\nEND: 46\nThese beings are created by Cell through some sort of cellular mitosis.  The\nexact method of reproduction in unknown.  These beings appear to have many of\nthe abilities and strengths of Cell, but lack Cell’s intelligence.  Their\ninternal make-up seems to be similar to Cell’s basic Structure.\n\n\n\nChiaotzu\nHP: 142\nSTR: 9\nPOW: 9\nEND: 7\nChiaotzu is a mysterious child-like being.  Despite his small stature and\nchildish looks, Chaiotzu has incredible telepathic powers, and has the ability\nto induce telekinetic paralysis on other beings.  Chiaotzu was once a student\nof the martial arts Master Shen, but later became a student of Master Roshi. He\nis often seen with the martial artist Tien.\n\n\n\nChi-Chi\nHP: 29\nSTR: 5\nPOW: 1\nEND: 4\nChi-Chi is the wife of Goku.  At one time Chi-Chi was a registered martial\nartist who participated in the World Martial Arts Tournament.  Chi-Chi is the\ndaughter of the infamous Ox-King of Fire Mountain.\n\n\nCooler\nHP: 10200\nSTR: 75\nPOW: 85\nEND: 79\nThis being is of extraterrestrial origin.  Cellular analysis indicates radical\npolymorphism and extreme levels of energy.  Heuristic database analysis\nindicates that this may be Cooler, the son of King Cold, but not enough data\nexists for a positive match.\n\n\nChi-Chi\nHP: 29\nSTR: 5\nPOW: 1\nEND: 4\nChi-Chi is the wife of Goku. At one time Chi-Chi was a registered martial\nartist who participated in the World Martial Arts Tournament.  Chi-Chi is the\ndaughter of the infamous Ox-King of Fire Mountain.\n\n\nDende\nHP: 172\nSTR: 22\nPOW: 32\nEND: 11\nThis being is unknown.  Cellular scanning reveals that this being is a member\nof the alien race called the Nameks.\n\n\nDestroyer\nHP: 1463, 3120, 4200\nSTR: 32, 46, 49\nPOW: 39, 42, 44\nEND: 29, 39, 43\nThis giant robot bears the insignia of the Red Ribbon Army.  Scanning indicates\nthis that this robot was designed for military purposes.  The thick geromantium\narmor on this robot makes it invulnerable to most conventional attacks.\n\n\nDog\nHP: 9\nSTR: 2\nPOW: 1\nEND: 2\nThese animals are often kept as obedient pets.  Most dogs walk on all fours,\nbut some dogs stand on their hind legs.  These upright dogs show a high\ncapacity for leadership, intelligence, and wisdom.  Many dogs occupy high\nranking positions in the military and public office.\n\n\n\n\nDr. Briefs\nHP: 36\nSTR: 3\nPOW: 1\nEND: 2\nDr. Briefs is the founder and president of the Capsule Corporation.  His\ngreatest achievement is the invention of the Dyna-Cap.  Dyna-Caps (often\nreferred to as Capsules) allow storage of large objects in a tiny capsule.\nThese advancements in miniaturization technology have changed the way that\nsociety works.\n\n\n\nEggbot\nHP: 250, 525, 1130, 1349\nSTR: 19, 35, 38, 47\nPOW: 25, 41, 44, 53\nEND: 18, 22, 34, 52\nThis egg-like robot bears the insignia of the Red Ribbon Army.  Scanning\nindicates that this humanoid robot is designed for the purpose of hand to hand\ncombat.  The arms of this robot are actuated using unusually Powerful hydraulic\npistons.\n\n\n\nFrieza\nHP: 1974\nSTR: 30\nPOW: 37\nEND: 20\nThis extraterrestrial being is believed to be a Powerful tyrant feared on many\nplanets.  Little is known about Frieza other than what has been discovered\nthrough the study of extraterrestrial broadcasts intercepted by space\ntelescopes, and other unsubstantiated reports.  Frieza is believed to be dead,\nhowever this is unconfirmed.\n\n\n\nGeneral Tao\nHP: 6400\nSTR: 50\nPOW: 55\nEND: 60\nGeneral Tao is a feared mercenary and assassin.  He has a reputation of being\nruthless and cunning.  He claims to have no problem with killing any man,\nwoman, or child as long as the price is right.  His cybernetic enhancements\nhave given him increased strength, cybernetic vision, and a special arm gun.\nGeneral Tao is a wanted man and is considered extremely dangerous.\n\n\n\nGohan\nHP: ???\nSTR: ???\nPOW: ???\nEND: ???\nGohan is the son of martial artist Goku.  Like his father, Gohan is a Powerful\nmartial artist, despite his young age.  Analysis of scouter data indicated\nuntapped potential not yet revealed.\n\n\n\nGoku\nHP: ???\nSTR: ???\nPOW: ???\nEND: ???\nGoku, despite his human appearance is actually an alien of the Saiyan race.\nMany Saiyans are considered highly dangerous.  In fact, two of these aliens\ndestroyed East City several years ago.  However, Goku has made no known\nthreatening moves towards the Earth.  Little about Goku is known ? however he\nis a Powerful martial artist who once won the World Tournament.  Goku trained\nunder Master Roshi.\n\n\n\nHawk\nHP: 110\nSTR: 10\nPOW: 1\nEND: 5\nThe hawk is a bird of prey.  Hawks have sharp beaks and acute vision.\n\n\n\nHercule\nHP: ???\nSTR: ???\nPOW: ???\nEND: ???\nThis wrestler claims to be the world champion of martial arts, but no data can\nbe found as to which championship he has won.  Despite this oversight, Hercule\nholds the world records for many feats of strength, such as pulling buses and\nbreaking piles of wood with a karate chop.  Hercule is one of the world’s most\npopular celebrities.\n\n\n\nHuman\nHP: 32\nSTR: 2\nPOW: 1\nEND: 2\nDatabase information on this person is restricted\n\n(Note: while there are many different humans the data for them other than the\npicture is identical)\n\n\n\nKami\nHP: 230\nSTR: 23\nPOW: 30\nEND: 13\nKami is the subject of many mysteries and superstitions.  Kami is said to live\nin a mystical floating castle, but this is more likely nothing more than\nlegend.  Analysis indicates that Kami is in fact an alien from the planet\nNamek.  Not much else is known about this being.\n\n\n\nKing Cold\nHP: 1180\nSTR: 24\nPOW: 28\nEND: 10\nKing Cold is believed to be the father of Frieza.  His brutal regime is\nnotorious in the inner galaxy.  Rumors say that he and his sons, Frieza and\nCooler, have been known to resort to any means necessary to achieve their\ngoals, including destroying entire planets.  King Cold’s ship was tracked by\nradar entering Earth’s atmosphere and was somehow destroyed.  Capsule\nCorporation scientists are currently studying the wreckage of the craft.\n\n\n\nKorin\nHP: 3470\nSTR: 25\nPOW: 59\nEND: 43\nKorin is the being that lives on top of Korin’s tower.  Korin was ling believed\nto be a myth, but recent evidence indicates that he does indeed exist.\nAttempts have been made to approach the top of the tower using aircraft, but\nthese attempts have failed.  Korin appears to be a cat, but analysis indicates\nthat he may be a more advanced being.\n\n\n\nKrillin\nHP: 1800\nSTR: 23\nPOW: 24\nEND: 17\nKrillin is an exceptional martial artist who trained under Master Roshi.\nKrillin is capable of performing a Powerful attack called the Destructo Disc.\nThe nature of this attack is unknown.  However, it is reported that this attack\ncan level a mountain top.  These reports are most likely exaggerated.\n\n\n\nKuma Mercenary\nHP: 125, 596, 940\nSTR: 17, 25, 35\nPOW: 1\nEND: 15, 20, 32\nThis bear is a member of the Kuma Mercenary Clan.  These soldiers are ruthless\nand cunning, and often resort to robbery when unemployed.\n\n\n\nLadybug\nHP: 29, 175, 700\nSTR: 1\nPOW: 7, 16, 32\nEND: 4, 11, 29\nThis flying robot bears the insignia of the Red Ribbon Army.  Scanning\nindicates that this robot is designed for surveillance purposes.  However this\nrobot is equipped for defense.\n\n\n\nMaron\nHP: 32\nSTR: 2\nPOW: 1\nEND: 2\nScouter analysis cannot detect any brain waves.  Perhaps the scouter is\nmalfunctioning?\n\n\n\nMaster Roshi\nHP: 87\nSTR: 9\nPOW: 15\nEND: 4\nMaster Roshi, often referred to as the “Turtle Hermit” is a martial arts Master\nwho has trained many great martial artists.  Historic texts from hundreds of\nyears ago speak of a Turtle Hermit known as Roshi, but it is impossible that\nthis is the same man.  Most likely he has assumed the Turtle Hermit’s name.\nRoshi is famous of his Kamehameha technique.\n\n\n\nMayor\nHP: 32\nSTR: 2\nPOW: 1\nEND: 2\nThis dog is the beloved mayor of West City.  He is a major advocate of dog’s\nrights.  He has served four terms as the mayor of West City and will soon be\nrunning for a fifth term.\n\n\n\nMr. Popo\nHP: 830\nSTR: 14\nPOW: 40\nEND: 25\nScanning reveals very little about this entity called Mr. Popo.  Power level\nanalysis indicates great power, but the data is very difficult to interpret\nproperly.  Cellular analysis is impossible since the scouter is unable to\ndistinguish any cells.\n\n\n\nMrs. Briefs\nHP: 32\nSTR: 2\nPOW: 1\nEND: 2\nMrs. Briefs is the wife of Dr. Briefs.  Shi is renowned for extraordinary\nbaking ability.\n\n\n\nNamek\nHP: 390\nSTR: 12\nPOW: 20\nEND: 26\nThis is a Namek.  No data in the Capsule Corporation Database about this being.\n\n\n\nNinja\nHP: 900, 1400\nSTR: 34, 37\nPOW: 25, 31\nEND: 27, 31\nThese warriors value stealth and subterfuge.  Some ninja use their ninjutsu\nskills for assassination and thieving.\n\n\n\nOolong\nHP: 56\nSTR: 3\nPOW: 2\nEND: 5\nOolong is a pig.  Analysis indicates that Oolong is smarter than the average\nswine.\n\n\n\nPiccolo\nHP: ???\nSTR: ???\nPOW: ???\nEND: ???\nPiccolo is a Powerful martial artist who once participated in the World\nTournament.  Piccolo is an alien to the Namek race.  Scanning of the Namek\ncellular Structure reveals that they are very similar to plants.  Not much is\nknown about them.  Antennas on their heads are believed to be used for\ntelepathic powers; however, they could simply be decorative.  Nameks have very\nlarge ears giving them an acute sense of hearing.\n\n\n\nPterodactyl\nHP: 900, 1200\nSTR: 28, 40\nPOW: 1\nEND: 16, 30\nOften mistaken for a dragon or dinosaur the pterodactyl is actually a flying\nreptile.  Pterodactyls can be quite cunning and intelligent hunters.\n\n\n\nPuar\nHP: 24\nSTR: 2\nPOW: 1\nEND: 2\nThis creature is often seen with the martial artist Yamcha.  Puar has the\nability to shapeshift.  This may be due to Puar’s higher than normal power\nlevel.\n\n\n\nSaber-Toothed Tiger\nHP: 750, 1500\nSTR: 32, 25*\nPOW: 1\nEND: 14, 21\nThis species of tiger has long razor sharp teeth.  They are fierce carnivores.\n\n* No, I did not make a mistake.  The does take a drop between the weaker and\nstronger tigers.\n\n\n\nScorpion\nHP: 110, 400, 2000\nSTR: 11, 18, 70\nPOW: 1\nEND: 5, 11, 56\nScorpions are arachnids with large claws and a tail ending with a poisonous\nstinger.  This venom of a scorpion is highly potent.  This particular species\nof scorpion is very large and aggressive.\n\n\n\nSnake\nHP: 35, 125, 275, 530\nSTR: 7, 10, 15, 32\nPOW: 1\nEND: 3, 5, 14, 28\nThese rattlesnakes are extremely aggressive and poisonous.\n\n\n\nSquirrel\nHP: 1\nSTR: 1\nPOW: 1\nEND: 1\nThis species of rodent is very cute and adorable.  They enjoy collecting nuts\nand have furry tails.\n\n\n\nTien\nHP: 2110\nSTR: 35\nPOW: 29\nEND: 27\nTien Shinhan is a highly skilled martial artist.  Tien trained under Master\nShen and later under Master Roshi.  Tien’s distinguishing feature is his third\neye.  It is believed that a third eye can be attained through intense\nmeditation concentrating on the pineal gland.  As a result Tien has telepathic\npowers.  Tien’s signature moves are the Tri-beam Cannon and the Solar Flare.\n\n\n\nTiger Bandit\nHP: 38, 325, 1120\nSTR: 6, 10, 34\nPOW: 3, 12, 42\nEND: 4, 8, 25\nThis is a member of the notorious Tiger Bandit Gang.  The Tiger Bandit Gang is\nwanted on many counts of thievery, pillaging, money laundering, kidnapping, and\ngeneral mayhem.\n\n\n\nT-Rex\nHP: 1750, 5120, 6700\nSTR: 40, 49, 55\nPOW: 1\nEND: 30, 55, 60\nThe tyrannosaurus rex (commonly referred to as T-Rex) is the largest carnivore\non the planet.  Although extremely dangerous, they are also very slow.\n\n\n\nTriceratops\nHP: 80, 275, 870\nSTR: 15, 20, 40\nPOW: 1\nEND: 14, 20, 40\nThese dinosaurs are herbivorous, but can often be extremely aggressive,\nespecially when it comes to territory.  Their head frills protect them from\nattack, and their horns are a dangerous weapon.\n\n\n\nTriceratops King\nHP: 850\nSTR: 21\nPOW: 1\nEND: 25\nTriceratops King is the leader of a triceratops tribe south of West City.\nRecently the Triceratops King’s army has been forcing the farmers off their\nland.  He is Powerful and old and has never lost a fight, even against the\nT-Rex.\n\n\n\nTrunks\nHP: ???\nSTR: ???\nPOW: ???\nEND: ???\nThere is no data on this person.  Cellular analysis indicates that Trunks has\nSaiyan and human DNA. Power level analysis indicates that Trucks is one of the\nmost Powerful fighters on the planet at this time.\n\n\n\nTurtle\nHP: 32\nSTR: 2\nPOW: 1\nEND: 2\nThis turtle is a very old aquatic sea turtle.\n\n\n\nVegeta\nHP: ???\nSTR: ???\nPOW: ???\nEND: ???\nThis Powerful Saiyan warrior is said to be responsible for the destruction of\nEast City.  There are not many people on Earth who could stop him.  This being\nsaid, Vegeta has not made any aggressive moves towards the planet since he\nbattled Goku.  Reports indicate that Goku and Vegeta are now allied, and Vegeta\nhas been seen at the Capsule Corporation.  Reasons are unknown.\n\n\n\nWarlord’s Henchman\nHP: 90, 900, 1100\nSTR: 2, 10, 15\nPOW: 8, 30, 42\nEND: 6, 26, 36\nThese henchmen are what’s left over from the army of the defeated Warlord who\nonce ruled the outskirts of West City.  Hercule is reported to have defeated\nthis Warlord.\n\n\n\nWarthog\nHP: 300\nSTR: 20\nPOW: 1\nEND: 14\nWarthogs are very dangerous boars.  They can be as fierce as they are ugly.\n\n\n\nWolf\nHP: 65, 400, 675, 1000\nSTR: 8, 11, 29, 65\nPOW: 1\nEND: 4, 5, 24, 35\nWolves are aggressive carnivores and often hunt in packs.\n\n\n\nYajirobe\nHP: 110\nSTR: 12\nPOW: 1\nEND: 15\nYajirobe is a swordsman often seen around the area of Korin’s Tower and is\nsometimes seen around Goku.\n\n\n\nYamcha\nHP: 800\nSTR: 18\nPOW: 12\nEND: 14\nYamcha was once a notorious bandit, and is now a professional athlete and\nmartial artist.  His signature martial arts move is the Wolf Fang Fist.  He\nplays baseball for the Titans.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOutro\nWell, that’s all the scouter data I have found.  As I find more I will keep\nthis guide updated.  I know I just Gotta catch ‘em all >_<\n\n\n\nSPECIAL THANKS\n\n-Me, for writing this guide (whew)\n\n-My brother, for how to get Kami\n\n-My Parents, for getting me this game.\n\n-The people who made this game (duh)\n\n-Various authors on Gamefaqs for unknowingly showing me how to do the Legal Data\n\n-Akira Toryama, for creating DBZ\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLegal Data\nThis guide is the sole property of me.  Nobody can use this guide on their\nwebsite other than www.gamefaqs.com.  Nobody, and I mean NOBODY has the right\nto rip off this guide and say it is their own work.  Anyone who does so is\npunishable by U.S. law.  Basically, don’t plagiarize the guide, man!!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nEnd of da’ guide\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"